results.description:
WIP model of m60a1 rise tank or m60 105mm gun tank. mostly accurately recreated from blueprint, reference pictures, and lineart. Some more bits have been added over previous upload WIP m60 tank such as later turret with armor neck and various bits.
Feel free to download and use however you want. Give credit if you use please ). Optimized high detail but Low poly model suitable for FPS games.

if you have any questions dont hesitate to comment )
